flowchart TD
    I[Implementation Stage] --> R[Review Stage]
    R --> V[Validation Stage]
    V --> E[Evaluation Stage]
    E --> D{Requirements Met?}
    D -- Yes --> A[Approval or Eligible Outcome]
    D -- No --> B{Retry Budget Available?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Correction Required]
    C --> I
    B -- No --> X[Escalation]
